OL,3,GNEWSAWomen sentenced for migrant
OL,4,Aprotest police assaults
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo women who admitted assaulting
OL,7,Fpolice officers during an anti-migrant
OL,8,Fprotest have been given suspended jail
OL,9,Fsentences.
OL,11,FHundreds of demonstrators gathered at
OL,12,Fthe former Haslar naval base in
OL,13,FGosport, Hampshire, on 22 September,
OL,14,Fbelieving that a group of asylum
OL,15,Fseekers would be landing after being
OL,16,Fpicked up in the Channel.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
