OL,3,GNEWSAWomen sentenced for migrant
OL,4,Aprotest police assaults
OL,5,
OL,6,FSally Pearson, 31, caused ligament
OL,7,Fdamage to an officer when she punched
OL,8,Fhim, and Shannon Dodds, 32, sprayed
OL,9,Fpersonal attack deterrent spray into
OL,10,Fpolice officers' faces, Portsmouth
OL,11,FCrown Court heard.
OL,13,FPearson was sentenced to eight months
OL,14,Fin prison, suspended for a year. Dodds
OL,15,Fwas sentenced to 10 months, suspended
OL,16,Ffor 18 months.
